  <title id="bdl01acfplots-title">Autocorrelation functions of the two random-walk Metropolis chains</title>
  <desc id="bdl01acfplots-desc">Bars give the sample autocorrelation at lags 0 to 36; dashed lines mark plus and minus 1.96 over the square root of 5000. Left, step size 0.9: the autocorrelation falls from 1 at lag 0 to 0.80 at lag 1 and decays geometrically, entering the band at about lag 14. Right, step size 0.01: the autocorrelation stays close to 1 (about 0.98 at lag 36) at every lag shown.</desc>
